1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
You are nine, and the mill wheel is louder than anything you have ever heard.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:15,000
By the end of this video you will know who gets paid for every sack of flour, and who only gets the dust.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Rank one is the boy at the hopper. You pour the grain, you watch the stones, and you never put your hand near them.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:01:10,000
The stones weigh more than a cart, and a careless boy loses fingers in his first winter.

5
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:25,000
But the boy is not the one the village hates. Stay with me for that.

6
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Rank two is the miller's man, who weighs every sack and keeps a share for the house.

7
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:30,000
The share is called the multure, and everyone in the village is sure he takes too much.

8
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:50,000
At the top is the lord, who owns the river, the wheel, and the right to grind.

9
00:02:50,000 --> 00:03:00,000
And that is why the miller was the most suspected man in every medieval story.
